OL,3,GNEWSAVigil held for four people injured
OL,4,Ain M9 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vigil has taken place in County
OL,7,FCarlow for the family injured in the
OL,8,Fcrash on the M9 in the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland last weekend.
OL,11,FFive teenagers were killed in a head-on
OL,12,Fcrash while they were driving the wrong
OL,13,Fway down the motorway in County Kildare
OL,14,Fin the early hours of Sunday.
OL,16,FThree women and a seven-year-old boy
OL,17,Fremain in hospital where they are being
OL,18,Ftreated for serious injuries.
OL,20,FIt is believed the injured family were
OL,21,Ftravelling to the airport to go on
OL,22,Fholiday when the crash happened.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
